### Add Challenge Encouragement - REST Client Tests
### Prerequisites: 
### 1. Server running at http://localhost:8080
### 2. Valid JWT token with authenticated user
### 3. Valid challenge key (e.g., from create challenge response)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Variables - UPDATE THESE BEFORE TESTING
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@challengeKey = CH-12345

### ========================================
### TEST 1: Successfully Add Encouragement (Count: 5)
### Expected: 201 CREATED with success response
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 2: Add Encouragement - Minimum Valid Count (1)
### Expected: 201 CREATED
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 1
}

### ========================================
### TEST 3: Add Encouragement - Maximum Valid Count (9)
### Expected: 201 CREATED
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 9
}

### ========================================
### TEST 4: Add Encouragement - Count Zero (Below Minimum)
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be greater than zero
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 0
}

### ========================================
### TEST 5: Add Encouragement - Count 10 (Above Maximum)
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be less than 10
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 10
}

### ========================================
### TEST 6: Add Encouragement - Count 100 (Far Above Maximum)
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be less than 10
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 100
}

### ========================================
### TEST 7: Add Encouragement - Negative Count
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be greater than zero
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": -5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 8: Add Encouragement - Null Count
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be provided
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": null
}

### ========================================
### TEST 9: Add Encouragement - Missing Count Field
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be provided
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
}

### ========================================
### TEST 10: Add Encouragement - Invalid Challenge Key
### Expected: 404 NOT_FOUND - Challenge not found
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/INVALID-KEY/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 11: Add Encouragement - No Authentication
### Expected: 401 UNAUTHORIZED - Missing JWT token
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "count": 5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 12: Add Encouragement - Invalid JWT Token
### Expected: 401 UNAUTHORIZED - Invalid JWT token
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer INVALID_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "count": 5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 13: Add Encouragement - Expired JWT Token
### Expected: 401 UNAUTHORIZED - Expired JWT token
### Note: Replace with an expired token for testing
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer EXPIRED_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "count": 5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 14: Add Multiple Encouragements to Same Challenge
### Expected: 201 CREATED for each request
### Note: Run this test multiple times to verify multiple encouragements work
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 3
}

### ========================================
### TEST 15: Security Test - Attempt to Override userKey
### Expected: 201 CREATED - userKey from JWT should be used, not from body
### Note: The userKey in the body should be ignored
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5,
  "userKey": "HACKER1"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 16: Security Test - Attempt to Override challengeKey
### Expected: 201 CREATED - challengeKey from path should be used, not from body
### Note: The challengeKey in the body should be ignored
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5,
  "challengeKey": "OTHER99"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 17: Add Encouragement - Count as String (Type Mismatch)
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Type mismatch error
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": "five"
}

### ========================================
### TEST 18: Add Encouragement - Count as Decimal
### Expected: 201 CREATED (should accept and truncate to integer) or 400 BAD_REQUEST
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5.5
}

### ========================================
### TEST 19: Add Encouragement - Empty Request Body
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Count must be provided
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ========================================
### TEST 20: Add Encouragement - Malformed JSON
### Expected: 400 BAD_REQUEST - Invalid JSON format
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cmd/challenge/{{challengeKey}}/encouragement
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
  "count": 5,
  invalid json
}

### ========================================
### INTEGRATION TESTS
### ========================================

### TEST 21: Full Workflow - Create Challenge, Then Add Encouragement
### Step 1: Create a challenge (requires separate test file)
### Step 2: Use the returned challengeKey in the encouragement request
### Expected: 201 CREATED for both operations
### ========================================

### TEST 22: Verify Encouragement Persisted (Query Challenge Detail)
### Run this after successful encouragement creation
### Expected: Challenge detail should show the encouragement in the encouragements list
### Note: Requires GET challenge detail endpoint
### ========================================
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qry/challenge/{{challengeKey}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ========================================
### PERFORMANCE TESTS
### ========================================

### TEST 23: Concurrent Encouragement Requests
### Run multiple requests simultaneously to test concurrency
### Expected: All requests should succeed without conflicts
### Note: Use load testing tool for better simulation
### ========================================

### ========================================
### NOTES FOR TESTING
### ========================================
# 1. Update @jwtToken variable with a valid JWT token before testing
# 2. Update @challengeKey with an existing challenge key
# 3. Ensure server is running at http://localhost:8080
# 4. Some tests are expected to fail (negative tests)
# 5. Check server logs for domain events published
# 6. Verify database state after successful operations
# 7. Test security scenarios (TEST 15-16) to ensure field hiding works
# 8. For integration tests, coordinate with other API endpoints
# 9. Monitor database for ChallengeEncouragements table entries
# 10. Check that challenge.updatedAt timestamp is refreshed

### ========================================
### VALIDATION CHECKLIST
### ========================================
# [ ] Count validation: 1-9 range enforced
# [ ] Null/missing count rejected
# [ ] Invalid challenge key returns 404
# [ ] Missing authentication returns 401
# [ ] Invalid token returns 401
# [ ] UserKey from JWT used (not from body)
# [ ] ChallengeKey from path used (not from body)
# [ ] Multiple encouragements supported
# [ ] Domain events published
# [ ] Challenge entity updated
# [ ] Encouragement persisted correctly
# [ ] Response codes match specification
# [ ] Error messages are descriptive
